# The baked data. Regenerate with `npm run data`.
#
# Every series file is derived from the PMEL ERDDAP and nothing here is its
# source of truth, so committing ~200 MB of JSON that changes whenever an
# active mission reports would put the repository's whole weight in files
# nobody reviews. CI builds them fresh and the deploy carries them; see
# PLAN.md for the caching that keeps that build short.
public/data/

# scratch
.DS_Store
*.part
